==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|pounds-force}}

# A unit of [[force]] equal to the weight, on earth (subject to standard gravity), of a mass of one [[avoirdupois]] [[pound]], equal to about 4.44822 [[newton]]s. Symbol [[lbf]] or lb<sub>f</sub>.

